# Production-only build-time configuration.
#
# Vite bakes every VITE_-prefixed value here into the public JS bundle, so
# ONLY public-by-design values belong in this file. Anyone can read them by
# downloading the bundle. Never add a private key, API secret, or token.
#
# Base44's Secrets panel feeds backend functions (secrets.get()) and does NOT
# reach this build, which is why these live here instead.
#
# The Canvas basemap intentionally does NOT live here. It is defined once in
# `.env`, which Vite loads in every mode, so the dev preview and the published
# app render the same map. Re-adding a basemap key here would recreate the
# two-variation bug where mobile and desktop showed different maps.

# Assignment-package trust anchor — intentionally NOT set yet.
# The previous keypair was exposed in chat, so its public half must not be
# pinned here. Add the three values below only after generating a new keypair
# locally and storing the private half in Base44 Secrets:
#   VITE_CANVAS_PACKAGE_SIGNING_PUBLIC_KEY=
#   VITE_CANVAS_PACKAGE_SIGNING_PUBLIC_KEY_FORMAT=spki
#   VITE_CANVAS_PACKAGE_SIGNING_KEY_ID=